                "text": "As Congress comes back into session this week, we have to stand by our values and the communities we serve through protecting nutrition assistance and health care. \n\nThank you to @SenBooker and @RepJeffries for leading a sit-in at the Capitol today. \n\nWe will keep fighting together to protect the will of the people.",
