                "text": "Trump\u2019s illegal shutdown of USAID is costing billions of U.S. taxpayer dollars and putting millions of lives on the brink. \n\nThe complicity of Congressional Republicans is letting children die from lack of access to lifesaving medical and nutrition assistance.",
